# CHANGELOG

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on **Keep a Changelog** and follows **Semantic Versioning (SemVer)** where applicable.

---

## [1.0.0] - 2026-07-27

### Added

* Initial release of the **Diabetes Metabolic Model**
* Educational systems-oriented metabolic model
* ASCII metabolic diagram
* Explanatory documentation
* Medical disclaimer
* Open-source documentation
* CC BY-SA 4.0 licensing
* Contribution guidelines
* Code of Conduct
* Project structure for future development

### Notes

This is the first public release of the project intended for educational purposes and community collaboration.

---

## Future Releases

Future versions may include:

* Graphical diagrams (SVG and PNG)
* Mermaid diagrams
* Additional physiological pathways
* References to scientific literature
* Multilingual documentation
* Educational examples
* Improved visualizations
* Community contributions
